  "question": {
    "text": "<p>As shown in the figure, a block of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> is kept on a horizontal rough surface of coefficient of friction <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>. The critical force to be applied on the vertical surface as shown at an angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> with horizontal such that it does not move, will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> will&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d2023317-9039-4e44-9af1-c0b4f73635c3-image.png\" style=\"width: 249px; height: 131px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3.33",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/dc592466-4b19-4f74-8b6e-54be0145526c-image.png\" style=\"width: 263px; height: 147px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>N</mi></math> or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>&amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>From equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math> &amp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math> Newton <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>So <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>33</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
